{"meta":{"id":"cee:316165","type":"series","name":"Ascendance of a Bookworm","poster":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/C3B46C27-6642-5A1B-CF80-6C027AB2A912_poster.jpg","background":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/C3B46C27-6642-5A1B-CF80-6C027AB2A912_poster.jpg","description":"A certain college girl who's loved books ever since she was a little girl dies in an accident and is reborn in another world she knows nothing about. She is now Maine, the sickly five-year-old daughter of a poor soldier. To make things worse, the world she's been reborn in has a very low literacy rate and books mostly don't exist. She'd have to pay an enormous amounts of money to buy one. Maine resolves herself: If there aren't any books, she'll just have to make them! Her goal is to become a librarian.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["رسوم متحركة","خيالي","شريحة من الحياة"],"cast":["Iguchi Yuka"],"director":["Hongou Mitsuru","Koyasu Takehito","Orikasa Fumiko"],"imdbRating":"7.1","runtime":"24 min","videos":[{"id":"cee:316165","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/C3B46C27-6642-5A1B-CF80-6C027AB2A912_poster.jpg","released":"2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:316166","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/1B85FE5D-1C8E-765D-B71D-B387176FA010_poster.jpg","released":"2019-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:316167","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/1B85FE5D-1C8E-765D-B71D-B387176FA010_poster.jpg","released":"2019-01-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:316168","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/1B85FE5D-1C8E-765D-B71D-B387176FA010_poster.jpg","released":"2019-01-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:316169","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vasc